{"articleNo":"110070","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=110070&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014-2학기 수강지도 상담 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.07.29","hit":"10815","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY울릉도M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014-2학기 수강지도 상담 안내</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 2학기 “수강지도상담”을 아래와 같이 안내하오니, 해당 학생들은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">“</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">수강 승인”</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">을 받으시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">수강지도 미승인 학생은 수강신청 불가함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 적용대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 재학생에 한하여 실시 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제외자 : 2014학년도 2학기 휴학자, </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">8월 8일 이후 복학자, </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 2학기 신(편)입생</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">월 1일부터 8월 8일까지 복학신청기간 동안 복학신청 학생은 수강지도상담 승인 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대상자이며 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 단, 2학기 복학생에 한하여 수강지도상담 미승인자도 수강신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">복학생은 복학 확정 이후 지도교수 배정과 동시에 자율적으로 지도교수상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">담을 받을 수 있음.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 수강지도상담 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 8. 1.(금) 09:00 ~ 8. 8.(금) 18:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 수강신청기간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">○ 1,4학년 : 8. 11.(월) 10:00 ~ 12.(화) 24:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">○ 2,3학년 : 8. 13.(수) 10:00 ~ 14.(목) 24:00 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">○ 신,편입생 수강신청기간 : 8. 25.(월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">○ 전체학년 수강신청기간 : 8. 26.(화)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 상담내역</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">교</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">과목 이수체계도 및 졸업요건 등을 충분히 숙지하여 교육과정 이수에 문제가 발생하지 않도록 하며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 부족한 학습 성과 항목을 체크하도록 함. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 2014학년도 2학기 개설강좌 조회 방법 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 홈페이지- 금오인- 학사정보- 개설과목 안내 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 원스톱서비스- 학사관리-수강신청-개설강좌조회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 수강지도상담 방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">지도교수에게 온,오프라인으로 상담을 받은 후 웹상으로 수강 승인을 받아야 함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가. 지도교수 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 수강지도상담 조회 시 지도교수정보 열람 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;○ </span>원스톱서비스 → 상담 → 수강지도상담 클릭 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 수강지도상담 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;○ </span>상담 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">e-mail/ 전화/ 면담</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 등의 방법으로 지도교수와 상담</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 지도교수와 수강상담이 된 경우 수강 승인 여부만 확인하면 됨.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">상담방법 및 기타사항은 해당 학부(과)에 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;○ </span>수강지도 승인 확인(원스톱→상담→수강지도상담조회)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">승인/미승인 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">이 된 경우 : 『승인여부』 화면에 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">“승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">“미승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 표시 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 유의 사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">수강지도상담 대상 학생 중 수강지도 미승인 학생은 수강신청을 할 수 없음. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 8.1 ~ 8.8 휴,복학 신청기간에 휴학신청 후 휴학신청 취소한 학생도 수강지도상담 승인 대상자 임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 수강지도기간에 수강 승인을 받지 못한 학생은 학부 사무실로 문의.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 수강지도기간 이후에도 수강 승인을 받아야 수강신청 가능함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 82.2pt; HEIGHT: 17.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">업무별</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 220.87pt; HEIGHT: 17.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">문 의 처</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 158.61pt; HEIGHT: 17.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: